{
  "claims": [
    {
      "claim": "Molecule 12 is the tetrasodium salt of the query's trypan-blue-type bis-azo tetrasulfonate scaffold. Direct experimental records show that although trypan blue is excluded by the intact BBB, it extravasates into brain tissue after systemic administration under multiple disrupted-barrier conditions, including collagenase-induced opening, lead encephalopathy, ischemia, air embolism, serotonin-induced permeability, and resuscitation-related BBB injury. This directly supports meaningful CNS access for the query under a disrupted biological barrier.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive",
      "molecule_ids": ["Molecule 12"],
      "record_ids": ["Record 12-3", "Record 12-4", "Record 12-19", "Record 12-22", "Record 12-24", "Record 12-27", "Record 12-29"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Related dye-class evidence also shows CNS access when the barrier is compromised: Pontamine sky blue produced progressive brain staining in infected mice with capillary endothelial leaks, and Evans blue leakage was increased ~2-fold in DR6-knockout mice with BBB deficits. These records confirm that large sulfonated azo dyes can achieve meaningful CNS access when the biological barrier is disrupted.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive",
      "molecule_ids": ["Molecule 13", "Molecule 14"],
      "record_ids": ["Record 13-1", "Record 13-2", "Record 14-1"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Intact-barrier and non-dye sulfonate records show impermeability or poor penetration (Evans blue/trypan blue exclusion in normal animals, Carmoisine no brain radioactivity, suramin poor BBB penetration, NXY-059 poor uptake in ischemia), but these lack the query's disrupted-barrier condition or the albumin-bound dye extravasation mechanism, so they are less transferable and do not override the direct disrupted-barrier dye-access evidence.",
      "evidence_role": "contradictory",
      "molecule_ids": ["Molecule 1", "Molecule 3", "Molecule 10", "Molecule 11", "Molecule 12", "Molecule 21"],
      "record_ids": ["Record 1-1", "Record 3-1", "Record 10-1", "Record 11-1", "Record 12-10", "Record 21-1"]
    }
  ],
  "final_prediction": "pass"
}
